# Reenact the Crime: the cast of the copy is optional ("you may cast the copy"). Bot1 bolts Bot2 on turn 1, then exiles the Bolt with
# Reenact the Crime and declines; the copy ceases to exist in exile (CR 707.10a, 704.5e) and the Bolt card stays exiled, so Bot2 has
# taken only the first 3 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Reenact the Crime
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
